What is Observer Design Pattern ?

In this Pattern,  when one object changes multiple other object need to know about the Change.

Think of It Like Youtube Channel, Where when ever user Upload a Videos multiple users get the notifications
who have subscribed the channel

It is like One to Many Relationship

Why to use Observer Design Pattern ?

Without Observer Design Pattern For Example When anyone order a Product i want once order is placed to call
notification, Update Inventory, Notify Admin ... N number of Operations
Then i  will do this stuff like

void orderplaced(){
  notification();
  updateInventory();
  notifyAdmin();
}

As we can see this are tightly coupled/connected.


With Observer Pattern, what i will do is when order is placed just notify all the observer

                   OrderPlaced
                        |
                    notifyObservers
                         |
    ________________________________________________
    |                    |                         |
Notification          UpdateInventory          notifyAdmin

So here we just notify the Observers and they will do their stuff



Observer -> Notify who needs to know something.
